PUBLIC SERVICES COMMITTEE
MINUTES
A meeting of the Public Services Committee was held on Monday, December 1, 2025, in City
Council Chambers and via electronic meeting, starting at 12:00 p.m. Those in attendance were as
follows:
COMMITTEE MEIIBERS:
Tom Segrave, Chainnan; Dr. Michelle Aldrich; Dr. Kathy
Emmons; and Jeff White (via Zoom).
AGENDA ITEMS
CLERK’S NOTE: Due to technical issue this meeting was not recorded.
7.
ORDINANCE -3 READING
Annexing to the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, various
tracts of land completely surrounded by current City limits situate in eastern Cheyenne,
generally located south of Laramie Street, east of I-Bird Drive, north of East Lincoinway
and US 30, and west of Parsons Place.
Dr. Aldrich moved to approve on 3rd and final reading, seconded by Dr. Emmons. Motion carried
by unanimous voice vote.
Connor White, Planning & Development Department, provided a staff report and advised there
have been no changes since approval on 2nd reading,
8.
ORDINANCE —3” READING
— Amending the Official Zoning Map of the City of
Cheyenne, establishing the zoning classifications of: MR
— Medium-Density Residential;
MUB
— Mixed-Use Business; and CB
— Community Business, for land annexed to the City
of Cheyenne generally located south of Laramie Street, east of T-Bird Drive, north of East
Lincolnway and US 30, and west of Parsons Place.
Dr. Aldrich moved to approve on 3” and final reading, seconded by Dr. Emmons. Motion carried
by unanimous voice vote.
Connor White, Planning & Development Department, provided a staff report and advised there
have been no changes since approval on 2’”’ reading.
9.
ORDINANCE —3”’ READING
— Annexing to the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, land
located south of Storey Boulevard, west of Converse Avenue, and north of East Carison
Street.
Dr. Aldrich moved to approve on 3”’ and final reading, seconded by Dr. Emmons. Motion carried
by unanimous voice vote.
```

